        "ai_gen_block_a1ca99e_TJNM7f": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_a1ca99e",
          "settings": {
            "meta_title": "",
            "meta_description": "",
            "heading": "<strong>What HIT IQ Is And Who It’s For</strong>",
            "subheading": "",
            "body_text": "<p>HIT IQ is a smart target system engineered specifically for live ammunition. A rugged, self healing target surface is paired with thermal sensor hit detection, integrated shot timing, and onboard analytics so every round fired becomes usable performance information on a tablet in real time.</p><p>For military live fire training, HIT IQ is designed for high throughput qualification, sustainment cycles, and complex courses of fire. Commands can manage multiple lanes from a single tablet, apply consistent standards, and keep digital records of shooter performance over time to support readiness assessments.</p><p>For law enforcement range training, HIT IQ replaces clipboards and manual paper scoring with a live fire target system that automates hit detection and timing. Academies, in service programs, and specialty teams gain an automatic scoring target system that cuts manpower on the line, standardizes results, and aligns easily with policy and documentation requirements.</p>",
