            "body_text": "<ol><li>Deploy HIT IQ targets on existing stands or frames in your live fire lanes or course of fire</li><li>Power on the target units and connect the instructor tablet over the secure wireless network</li><li>Select the qualification, sustainment drill, or custom course of fire you want to run</li><li>Run live fire strings while thermal sensors capture each hit and the integrated timer records all splits and totals</li><li>Review hit maps, scores, and timing data immediately on the tablet for coaching and go or no go decisions</li><li>Store or export shooter data for AARs, training folders, and readiness reporting</li><li>Reset the drill in software and move to the next shooter without pasting or replacing targets, keeping the line hot</li></ol>",
