            "meta_description": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Specs And Compatibility</strong>",
            "subheading": "",
            "body_text": "<ul><li><strong>Hit Detection And Target Surface</strong>: Thermal sensor hit detection on a self healing target surface designed for sustained live fire target system use in military live fire training and law enforcement range training</li><li><strong>Operating Temperature</strong>: 10°F to 140°F</li><li><strong>Hit Detection Performance</strong>: Up to 60° off axis; hit tolerance 5 mm at target center and 8 mm at target edge; detection time 300 milliseconds</li><li><strong>Supported Calibers</strong>: All calibers over 750 fps minimum projectile velocity</li><li><strong>Power And Battery</strong>: Battery life up to 12 hours; 6 amp hour standard, field replaceable battery; 12 to 24 V DC input; operates on battery or hardwired power</li><li><strong>Automated Scoring And Timing</strong>: Integrated automated scoring engine with hit factor style metrics and shot timing, delivering an electronic scoring target system built to be the best scoring system for military and law enforcement ranges when objective data is required</li><li><strong>Communications</strong>: Wireless operation over 802.11ac WiFi; connection distance up to 200 meters direct and up to 1 mile with a point to point Wi Fi bridge</li><li><strong>System Compatibility</strong>: Multi target control from a single compatible tablet so one device runs several lanes; mobile platforms supported include Android and iOS for a flexible smart target system</li><li><strong>Durability</strong>: Target life rated up to 10,000 rounds</li><li><strong>Physical</strong>: Dimensions 66 × 43.5 × 26.5 in; weight 140 lb</li></ul><p><strong>Deployment</strong>: Portable, modular, weather ready design that mounts quickly on existing stands, turning HIT IQ into live fire training targets with analytics as part of a modern firearms training system for law<br/><br/></p>",
